---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Social media & paid campaigns (Ads) | SEZMOO"
  description="Social media management at SEZMOO: strategy, running your channels, content production, publishing, moderation and reporting. Photo, video and design in-house. Gdańsk, Poland."
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Social media <span style="color:#ffd200">management.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1"><b>Social media at SEZMOO draws on the whole team.</b></p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">With photo, video and design in-house we can run the communication and produce the material that communication needs at the same time.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Scope</span><strong>Strategy · content · Ads</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Copywriting</span><strong>Written by us</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Contact</span><strong>One project manager</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Data</span><strong>Analytics and reports</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/byd-80646909-1280.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/byd-80646909-800.webp 800w, /assets/optimized/lcp/byd-80646909-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="100vw" width="1280" height="853" alt="BYD Plichta" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption><b>BYD Plichta</b><span>Social video / launch content</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we do</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Social media strategy</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We set the direction for the brand on social – audiences, tone of voice, content pillars and how each channel is used.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Social media strategy</span><span>Audit</span><span>Target audiences</span><span>Tone of voice</span><span>Content pillars</span><span>Content concept</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Running your channels</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We take over day-to-day channel management – planning, schedule, publishing and everything that keeps the profiles alive.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Channel management</span><span>Publishing schedule</span><span>Post publishing</span><span>Content planning</span><span>Moderation</span><span>Community management</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Content production</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Content is made in-house – from the idea and copywriting to design, photography, reels and larger video productions.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Copywriting</span><span>Reels</span><span>Photography</span><span>Video</span><span>Design</span><span>Stories</span><span>Carousels</span><span>Animation</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Publishing &amp; moderation</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We make sure the content actually reaches the channels – on schedule, in the right format for each platform – and handle day-to-day moderation and replies.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Publishing</span><span>Post scheduling</span><span>Comment moderation</span><span>Messages</span><span>Community management</span><span>Monitoring</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Reporting &amp; optimisation</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We analyse how published content performs and use the data to plan the next round of work.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Reports</span><span>Analytics</span><span>Reach</span><span>Engagement</span><span>Content performance</span><span>Optimisation</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>From plan to <span style="color:#ffd200">publishing.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Strategy</h3><p>We set the direction, goals and tone.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Schedule</h3><p>We plan topics and posts for the coming period.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Content</h3><p>We produce copy, design, photo and video.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Publishing &amp; moderation</h3><p>We run the channels and the day-to-day conversation.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Analysis</h3><p>We review results and plan what comes next.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zespol">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>All in one <span style="color:#ffd200">team.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Social media</h3><p>Strategy, schedule, publishing and moderation.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Copywriting</h3><p>Posts, campaigns and scripts.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Design</h3><p>Graphics, carousels and animation.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Photo</h3><p>Product, brand and event sessions.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Video</h3><p>Reels, ads and content productions.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/plichta/oj-omoda7-1.jpg" alt="Plichta – Content · Social media" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Content · Social media</span><h3>Plichta ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-primespot/"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/primespot/pjur-blue-story-1.jpg" alt="PrimeSpot – Stories · Campaign" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Stories · Campaign</span><h3>PrimeSpot ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja/baltic-towers-otwarcie/"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/work/baltic-robert-2.avif" alt="Baltic Towers – Employer branding · Video" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Employer branding · Video</span><h3>Baltic Towers ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
